From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Derek Ross <derekross@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 13:26:46 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: net: nfc: st,st-nci: add ST54J

The ST54J (NFC controller and secure element in one package, used in
Google's Pixel 7 phones) has an NCI controller that is reached like the
ST21NFCC over I2C. Add its compatible with st,st21nfcc-i2c as the fallback.

Assisted-by: LLM
Signed-off-by: Derek Ross <derekross@gmail.com>
---
 .../devicetree/bindings/net/nfc/st,st-nci.yaml       | 12 ++++++++----
 1 file changed, 8 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/net/nfc/st,st-nci.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/net/nfc/st,st-nci.yaml
index 1dcbddbc5..061367be5 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/net/nfc/st,st-nci.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/net/nfc/st,st-nci.yaml
@@ -11,10 +11,14 @@ maintainers:
 
 properties:
   compatible:
-    enum:
-      - st,st21nfcb-i2c
-      - st,st21nfcb-spi
-      - st,st21nfcc-i2c
+    oneOf:
+      - enum:
+          - st,st21nfcb-i2c
+          - st,st21nfcb-spi
+          - st,st21nfcc-i2c
+      - items:
+          - const: st,st54j-i2c
+          - const: st,st21nfcc-i2c
 
   reset-gpios:
     description: Output GPIO pin used for resetting the controller
